Subject: [PATCH 1/5] arm64: dts: qcom: sm8750: add Realme GT7 Pro (pista) and Adreno 830

Add Adreno 830 GPU/GMU/GXCLKCTL nodes to sm8750.dtsi and add the full
Realme GT7 Pro (pista, RMX5010) device tree with USB 2.0 gadget, WCN7860
Wi-Fi 7, Synaptics S3910 SPI touchscreen, Adreno 830 GPU, and native
DPU 12.0 + DSI0 + AB849 120Hz DSC OLED display.
---
